  "description": "Complete firmware suite for EvilCrowRF-V2. Features SubGhz and nRF24 capabilities controlled through a mobile app via BLE/USB serial. Multilanguage UI, wireless operation, and extensive RF toolkit for security research and pentesting. Open-source and community-driven.",
